(Kestrel Telemetry Pipeline Manual - Page 1) Tj
T* (Section 1: Frame Verification) Tj
T* (Invoke kestrel.frame.verify\(\) to validate CRC-32C checksums on incoming telemetry packets.) Tj
T* (Corrupted frames are routed to the quarantine ring for offline inspection.) Tj
T* (Standard ingestion pipelines process frames in deterministic sequence order.) Tj
