(Kestrel Telemetry Pipeline Manual - Page 4) Tj
T* (Section 4: Hot Cache Retention) Tj
T* (Hot telemetry partitions remain queryable in NVMe cache for 36 hours.) Tj
T* (Collector hosts monitor NVMe wear gauges during hourly health sweeps.) Tj
T* (Operators inspect cache hit ratios via the local collector dashboard.) Tj
ET
