(Kestrel Telemetry Pipeline Manual - Page 5) Tj
T* (Section 5: Cold Archival Retention) Tj
T* (Cold parquet bundles are retained in archival object storage for 180 days.) Tj
T* (Lifecycle sweeps execute nightly at 02:15 UTC.) Tj
T* (Archive integrity manifests are verified every Sunday before pruning.) Tj
ET
